\subsection*{Sequence Diagram 3: Worker Accepts Job Request}

Figure~\ref{fig:sd03} illustrates the sequence of interactions that occur
when a worker receives and responds to a job offer. The worker's
\texttt{streamWorkerJobs} Firestore listener surfaces the pending job
document on the worker's dashboard. Expired offers are filtered out
