\subsection*{UI Screen 1:User login and Sign up Screen}

The authentication module manages user entry and account creation through distinct Login and Sign Up interfaces.

Login Screen: Features a "Welcome back" interface where existing users authenticate using their registered email address and password. It includes toggleable password visibility, a "Forgot password?" recovery option, a "Continue" action button, and a direct navigation link to the registration flow for new users.

Sign Up Screen: Provides a comprehensive onboarding form to create a new account. It collects essential user profile data including full name, email address, mobile number pre-populated with a Pakistani country code (+92), and a CNIC number for identity verification. Security credentials are established via matching password and confirmation fields with visibility toggles. The form finishes with a category selection dropdown and a required profile picture upload utility capped at a 100KB file size.

