\subsection*{UI Screen 2: Customer Home Screen}

The Customer Home Screen serves as the primary dashboard for users upon authentication, providing a streamlined interface to discover and book services.

Header \& Search: The top header features a location-awareness indicator (showing the current active area), a language selector toggle, and a prominent search bar prompting users to input their required services.

Service Discovery: Below the header, a "Favorite Workers" shortcut allows users to quickly access and rehire preferred providers directly. Primary service categories (such as Electrician and Plumber) are presented as clean, grid-based selection cards.

Top Rated Workers: A dedicated list displays highly-rated available service providers, complete with a "See all" option. Each worker card shows the provider's name, profile avatar, service category, and base pricing rate.

Bottom Navigation \& Voice Control: The persistent bottom navigation bar organizes core application sections: Home, Bookings, Chat, and Settings. A prominent circular voice icon is positioned at the center of the navigation bar to support voice-activated commands and accessibility.
