\subsection*{UI Screen 3: Worker Home Screen}

The Worker Home Screen features a simplified, highly visual layout optimized for ease of use and quick action.

Header \& Availability Status: The top header displays the worker's avatar, name, and registered skill category. Directly below, a prominent status banner houses a large toggle switch to control online availability, giving clear visual confirmation of the worker's active status.

Job Offers Area: The main body of the screen is dedicated to incoming job offers, displaying real-time updates and notifications (such as "No new jobs yet" when inactive) to keep the worker updated on available tasks without cluttering the workspace.

Bottom Navigation \& Voice Utility: A persistent bottom navigation bar provides direct access to core features: Dashboard, Earnings, Chat, and Settings. A centralized, circular voice icon is integrated at the bottom to support voice-activated assistance and hands-free control.

