\subsection*{UI Screen 6: Job Completion Screen}

The Job Completion Screen coordinates the final phase of a service booking
by providing visual confirmation of job completion, payment collection, and
feedback readiness. It confirms that the active service session has reached
its completed state and presents the final payment outcome clearly to the
user.

The upper portion of the interface contains an active map that tracks the
service location coordinates during the session. A prominent, high-contrast
SOS emergency button appears at the top right to support user safety and
quick assistance if needed. At the bottom, a modal receipt sheet displays
the success message ``Job and payment completed!'', the final amount
received, and a structured breakdown containing the job type, customer name,
payment method, and total transaction amount.

