\subsection*{UI Screen 7: Incoming Job Offer Screen}

The Incoming Job Offer Screen presents real-time job requests directly to
online workers, allowing them to quickly evaluate and respond to customer
offers. The top banner maintains the worker's active status profile and
includes an availability toggle switch, confirming that the worker is
online and eligible to receive incoming requests.

A prominent ``New Job!'' card appears in real time and displays the
critical booking details needed for quick decision making. These details
include the requested service or issue type, such as Water Tap Leakage,
the customer's username, a live countdown timer showing the remaining time
to act on the offer, the selected payment method, and the offered payout
amount. The screen provides two high-contrast response actions: a
red-bordered ``Reject'' button to dismiss the offer and a solid ``Accept''
button to claim the job and begin the tracking flow.

