\subsection*{UI Screen 8: Admin Interface}

The Admin Interface serves as the central control panel for platform
administrators to monitor system health and manage daily operational
workflows. Its dashboard header provides immediate visibility into key
platform metrics, including active worker counts, pending complaints, and
total refund figures.

A structured quick-action menu supports core administrative tasks such as
reviewing damage claims, managing security deposits, accessing platform
statistics, and administering customer and service-provider accounts. The
interface also includes an activity-monitoring feed that tracks recent
platform events, such as job completions and operational updates, to
support real-time oversight. A bottom navigation bar provides dedicated
paths for managing workers, monitoring jobs, and resolving user complaints.

