\subsection*{UI Screen 9: Worker Verification and Approval Screen}

The Worker Verification and Approval Screen allows administrators to review
pending worker applications and verify credentials before granting active
platform access. The upper section presents the worker's profile and
registration details with a visible pending-status indicator, including
identification and contact information such as email, phone number, CNIC,
and localized service category.

A dedicated document-verification area supports administrative review of
uploaded background and skill records. This includes police certificate
details for security clearance, specialization certificate details for
trade verification, and CNIC document images for identity confirmation.
The screen enables administrators to make an informed approval or rejection
decision based on the worker's submitted profile and documents.

